%T A401952 9793522052534230
%N A401952 Number of labeled 2-connected graphs with n vertices in which every edge belongs to a triangle.
%F A401952 Let A(x) = Sum_{n>=2} a(n)*x^n/n! and B(x) = Sum_{n>=1} A401951(n)*x^n/n!. Then x*B'(x) = x*exp(A'(x*B'(x))).
%e A401952 a(4) = 7: the 2-connected graphs on 4 labeled vertices in which every edge belongs to a triangle are K_4 and the 6 graphs obtained by deleting one edge from K_4.
%Y A401952 Cf. A401951 (labeled connected graphs), A401950 (unlabeled 2-connected graphs), A396149 (unlabeled connected graphs), all with the property that every edge belongs to a triangle.
